From 2555ef9ad1a8199607f1989cdc355d64b893b70a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 14:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 0242: Brazilian Portuguese as a third runtime language

OPTIONS lists only the languages present on the disc. Portuguese uses its own
file copies, overlays, patch and texture layouts. The shared padding bank keeps
all language strings at the same addresses, including unbanked US defaults;
identity padding avoids aliases that hold in two languages but not in a third.
Portuguese has its own triangle labels, title/finisher crops and LUTA blocks.
